      "value": "I don't think this is necessarily a bug. The screenshot and description shows you're trying to report the instance text (#17528), not the world.\n\nThe button to report the world instead of the instance exists in the top right. It makes no sense to report your own instance text, even with the dialogue asking for clarification.",
