  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When trying to report a world, there is no option to do so from the website. So you have to open the game and report there. To join from the website, you have to create an instance. Once you do, the game opens and puts you in your instance. When selecting the world, the report button does not work. It gives the error \"you cannot report your own content\". I did not upload the world. Let me report it please. when the instance is created by another user, this report button asks if you want to report the instance kr the world.",
